      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HATSUMOMO (7) firmed from $5.50 to $4.20 on debut back in June but left her run too late and finished a close fourth over this distance at Gosford. Has not raced since but has trialled twice, the latest a placing at Warwick Farm. Looks the one to beat in a race where the exposed form is nothing to write home about. DIVINE OFFERING (4) was solidly backed when fresh from a spell over 1250m at Canterbury last time out but found one better after coming from just off the pace on cornering. Not sure coming back in distance is the right move but in a race that lacks depth he is a chance. REBEL ROYAL (1) is first-up since a moderate debut over today's journey at Randwick six months ago. Trialling as though he is ready to come back in better order. STORM SEEKER (2) is a half-brother to Group 1 winner Transatlantic on debut for the Michael Freedman stable. Trials have been solid. Sure to be on punters' radar. MISS GAMBIT (8) ran on well here last time and is an each-way hope again.",
